{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/71020-barring-a-miracle","id":71020,"title":"Barring a miracle...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-12T20:47:54-08:00","id":71020,"title":"Barring a miracle...","content":"So, to make a long story short, my parents are going to lose their car unless we can pay $2,000 by Febuary 18th. We don\u2019t have that kind of money. We just don\u2019t. If that happens, I\u2019ll be the only one in the house with a working vehicle. My stepmum works 60+ hours a week, I have two jobs, and my mom has <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parkinson%27s_disease\" target=\"_blank\">Parkinson\u2019s Disease</a>. It would be almost impossible for me to keep working both jobs if they lose their car. Frankly, this is scarier than the month and a half I was living on $15 a week.<br /> <br /> We need help.<br /> <br /> So here\u2019s the deal. I\u2019m taking donations and emergency commissions; sketches and colored sketches only. Check <a href=\"http://tludoesart.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">this blog</a> and the linked images for samples of my work. I\u2019m also offering a few special deals because I am not gonna lie, even though there\u2019s a sale on I am not cheap.<br /> Sketches - cleaned up enough I could color them, black or eye-searing at your discretion.<ul><li>Busts/Avatars - $20</li> <li>Halfbody - $30</li> <li>Fullbody - $40</li> </ul><br /> Colored Sketches - you can get <a href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24676611/falcon.png\" target=\"_blank\">smooth</a>, <a href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24676611/mirit%20doodleoodle.png\" target=\"_blank\">rough</a>, or <a href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24676611/rhoq-portrait.png\" target=\"_blank\">sumi-e</a> lines; for shading add $15, for a background add $25; other color options available on request.<ul><li>Busts/Avatars - $30</li> <li>Halfbody - $45</li> <li>Fullbody - 60</li> <li>Reference Sheet - $120 - Includes one full body and two busts, other configurations available on request [pricing may differ].</li> </ul><br /> Specials!<ul><li>Icon Four-pack - $100, colored sketches</li> <li>Icon Two-pack - $50, colored sketches</li> <li>Your Character Here - <a href=\"http://31.media.tumblr.com/5983d7d72a4540e2a0673a0715d15b84/tumblr_n0uzfgTTLQ1sih470o2_1280.png\" target=\"_blank\">Standing</a> or <a href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24676611/roll.png\" target=\"_blank\">stretching</a> - $20 for lines, $40 for color [Save $20!]</li> <li>Your Character Here - <a href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24676611/prayer%20dolls.png\" target=\"_blank\">Dolly</a> - $10 and up; $15 and up for color [Pay what you want as long as you hit the minimum.]</li> <li>&quot;I don\u2019t want art.&quot; - I will write you a short <a href=\"http://tluthal.tumblr.com/tagged/Shattered+Hearts+and+Homes+Prana\" target=\"_blank\">Shattered Hearts and Homes</a> fic. It will be dumb.</li> </ul><br /> While we only <i>need</i> $2000, I\u2019d really like to surprise my parents with two more payments so that we have time to get our shit together, so if I could get $3000 it would be really fantastic of you guys. Donations are also cool if you don\u2019t want anything.<br /> Contact me at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#acd8c0d9d8c4cdc0ecc3d9d8c0c3c3c782cfc3c1\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"84f0e8f1f0ece5e8c4ebf1f0e8ebebefaae7ebe9\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.<br /> <br /> If you can't afford to help, I'd really appreciate some signal boosting. [url=http://tludoesart.tumblr.com/post/76377771283/open-for-emergency-commissions-so-to-make-a;Here's a tumblr post you can link around and reblog[/url].<br /> <br /> [Note to the admins: If this breaks any rules [I think, given I'm asking for donations, it doesn't, but just in case] I am more than happy to take the thread down.]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tludoesart.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">Check out my art here!</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Mu-Kbt6birt-A0ODsNbqabRC0PRG5brJtKl48DUou7c/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">You can see my stuff from the old forum here.</a><br /> Two Exalted Bound In Chains of the Sun","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/35-tluthal","name":"tluthal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar35_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-12T22:22:12-08:00","id":71051,"title":"","content":"Do you have any ability to borrow money? Without taking out payday loans, of course, because those things are awful.<br /> <br /> Because this sounds like the sort of thing loans were made for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T05:44:23-08:00","id":71198,"title":"","content":"When I had a problem paying the bills, I requested &quot;forbearance&quot; for a couple of months on my car loan. And it was no problem. And another time I requested a consolidation loan, which got all my credit card bills, auto loan, and school loan under one bill that was under the bank.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T07:15:44-08:00","id":71256,"title":"","content":"Damn, tluthal, I'm sorry for your difficulties. I guess you live where public transportation isn't really an option, huh?<br /> <br /> I get paid late on Friday. I know it's close to the wire, but I'll be able to donate at the end of the week. It won't be much, but I'm happy to do it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T10:51:36-08:00","id":71431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sanctaphrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/71020-barring-a-miracle?p=71051#post71051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you have any ability to borrow money? Without taking out payday loans, of course, because those things are awful.<br /> <br /> Because this sounds like the sort of thing loans were made for.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's already a loan they're trying to pay off. :/<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/71020-barring-a-miracle?p=71198#post71198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When I had a problem paying the bills, I requested &quot;forbearance&quot; for a couple of months on my car loan. And it was no problem. And another time I requested a consolidation loan, which got all my credit card bills, auto loan, and school loan under one bill that was under the bank.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given it's a &quot;you have to pay this or you're defaulting on the loan&quot; situation... I'll suggest it to them, but I don't think it's an option.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/71020-barring-a-miracle?p=71256#post71256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Damn, tluthal, I'm sorry for your difficulties. I guess you live where public transportation isn't really an option, huh?<br /> <br /> I get paid late on Friday. I know it's close to the wire, but I'll be able to donate at the end of the week. It won't be much, but I'm happy to do it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it really isn't. Thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tludoesart.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">Check out my art here!</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Mu-Kbt6birt-A0ODsNbqabRC0PRG5brJtKl48DUou7c/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">You can see my stuff from the old forum here.</a><br /> Two Exalted Bound In Chains of the Sun","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/35-tluthal","name":"tluthal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar35_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T11:16:52-08:00","id":71451,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tluthal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/71020-barring-a-miracle?p=71431#post71431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's already a loan they're trying to pay off. :/</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tluthal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/71020-barring-a-miracle?p=71431#post71431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given it's a &quot;you have to pay this or you're defaulting on the loan&quot; situation... I'll suggest it to them, but I don't think it's an option.</div> </div> </div> </div>Forbearance might work. The bank would rather be paid back than see you default, after all.<br /> <br /> Consolidation loans are good too, I hear, but I dunno whether one would be practical here. I'm not an expert.<br /> <br /> That aside...can I buy a drawing for later? I don't have much need for art right now, but I expect to need some when my Burn Legend book project moves into its next phase.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T11:22:43-08:00","id":71455,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sanctaphrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/71020-barring-a-miracle?p=71451#post71451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That aside...can I buy a drawing for later? I don't have much need for art right now, but I expect to need some when my Burn Legend book project moves into its next phase.</div> </div> </div> </div>Absolutely!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-di